
Challenge 076, Task #2: Word Search (Raku)

Usage:
  raku ch-2.raku [--grid=<Str>] [--dict=<Str>] [--min[=UInt]]
  
    --grid=<Str>    Name of file containing a word search grid [default: './../lib/example-gr…']
    --dict=<Str>    Name of a dictionary file: valid words, one per line [default: './../lib/linuxwords…']
    --min[=UInt]    Minimum search-word length (must be > 0) [default: 5]
